  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e4a18dcb900b4754bb23c2b0400a39ed, type: 3}
  m_Name: START Dialog
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  assetID: uvod_dialog
  lines:
  - speakerName: Profesor Vlada
    text: "Dragi istra\u017Eiva\u010Du, svaki kamen, skulptira, fasada ili naziv
      ulice u Somboru \u010Duvaju neispri\u010Dane pri\u010De generacija koje su
      ovde \u017Eivele."
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextOnChoice0: {fileID: 0}
    nextOnChoice1: {fileID: 0}
    triggerGlitch: 0
    glitchPattern: []
    glitchDuration: 0
  - speakerName: Profesor Vlada
    text: "Ispitivanjem javnih prostora otvara\u0161 vrata ka nekim pri\u010Dama
      i obi\u010Dajima rasutim po zidovima i plo\u010Dnicima."
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextOnChoice0: {fileID: 0}
    nextOnChoice1: {fileID: 0}
    triggerGlitch: 0
    glitchPattern: []
    glitchDuration: 0
  - speakerName: Profesor Vlada
    text: "Skulpture na trgovima \u010Desto su podignute kao spomenici hrabrosti
      ili se\u0107anja na doga\u0111aje koji su promenili tok istorije."
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextOnChoice0: {fileID: 0}
    nextOnChoice1: {fileID: 0}
    triggerGlitch: 0
    glitchPattern: []
    glitchDuration: 0
  - speakerName: Profesor Vlada
    text: "Skulpture na trgovima \u010Desto su podignute kao spomenici hrabrosti
      ili se\u0107anja na doga\u0111aje koji su promenili tok istorije."
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextOnChoice0: {fileID: 0}
    nextOnChoice1: {fileID: 0}
    triggerGlitch: 0
    glitchPattern: []
    glitchDuration: 0
  - speakerName: Profesor Vlada
    text: "I nazivi ulica, predstavljaju tragove me\u0111ukulturne saradnje i raznih
      naroda koji su nekada, ali i danas, preplitali svoje \u017Eivote na ovim prostorima."
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextOnChoice0: {fileID: 0}
    nextOnChoice1: {fileID: 0}
    triggerGlitch: 0
    glitchPattern: []
    glitchDuration: 0
  - speakerName: Profesor Vlada
    text: "Sve te znamenitosti grade mozaik koji otkriva ko smo bili i ko smo postali
      kroz vekove. Tvoj zadatak je da otkrije\u0161 te slojeve zna\u010Denja i dopuni\u0161
      slagalicu pro\u0161losti sopstvenim zapa\u017Eanjima."
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextOnChoice0: {fileID: 0}
    nextOnChoice1: {fileID: 0}
    triggerGlitch: 0
    glitchPattern: []
    glitchDuration: 0
  - speakerName: Profesor Vlada
    text: "A sada se zaputi ka centru grada, tamo te \u010Dekaju veliki gradski trgovi!"
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextOnChoice0: {fileID: 0}
    nextOnChoice1: {fileID: 0}
    triggerGlitch: 0
    glitchPattern: []
    glitchDuration: 0
